      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KRAKEN MAIN (2) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when fourth (22.55), beaten 6 lengths. Has ability and is a key runner. CHAIN DRIVE (4) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 24.55 beating Gotham Thanos. Should feature again. CHAPPY'S BANSHEE (1) struggled to get involved last start after missing the jump at Geelong, but prior to that won comfortably by 5 lengths at Geelong (22.87) beating Paw Hailee in a Rank Limit - Grade 6 on August 11. The form out of her last race has been franked. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. HARTLAND BUDDY (7) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
